:Person rdf:type owl:Class .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/kemp/ontologies/2019/3/untitled-ontology-1#Postgraduate
:Postgraduate rdf:type owl:Class ;
              rdfs:subClassOf :Student .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/kemp/ontologies/2019/3/untitled-ontology-1#Program
:Program rdf:type owl:Class .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/kemp/ontologies/2019/3/untitled-ontology-1#SeniorTeacher
:SeniorTeacher rdf:type owl:Class ;
               rdfs:subClassOf :Teacher .


