:Teacher rdf:type owl:Class ;
         rdfs:subClassOf :Person .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/kemp/ontologies/2019/3/untitled-ontology-1#TeachingAssistant
:TeachingAssistant rdf:type owl:Class ;
                   rdfs:subClassOf :Student ,
